Hi Larkspur team,

Hope you're all doing great. I'm reaching out because I'm looking to hire the=
 1961 Hartwell Kestrel for my daughter's wedding - big occasion, lots of exci=
tement. We were thinking of picking it up on 19th March 2027 at 11.30am and b=
ringing it back on Sunday 21 March 2027 at 18:00. I was wondering if you coul=
d bring it to Studio 9, Quarry Lane and collect it from there afterwards? We =
would really appreciate it if we could have it with a chauffeur. I've attache=
d my driving licence, so you can verify everything is in order.=20

Looking forward to hearing back from you.
